@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Data Sources Layer

start
:Initialize Device Simulator Service;
:Load Device Profiles (vendor, device type, IP, OIDs);
:Generate metrics/events;
if (Event type?) then (SNMP Trap)
  :Format OID/value pair;
  :Send via UDP 162;
else (Syslog)
  :Format message and severity;
  :Send via UDP 514;
endif
:Wait for next event cycle;
stop
@enduml
